[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m At times t=1,2,\dots,10^{100}, the blocks are moved according to the following rules:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m - If the entire bottom row is filled with blocks, then all blocks in the bottom row are removed.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m - For each remaining block, in order from bottom to top, perform the following:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m - If the block is in the bottom row, or if there is a block in the cell immediately below it, do nothing.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=536682)[0m - Otherwise, move the block one cell downward.
